"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n4le01ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kathleen</span>: Hey, how's it going? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kyle</span>: Hi, pretty good, thanks. And you?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kathleen</span>: Great! I suppose you are the new co-worker. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kyle</span>: Yes, I am. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kathleen</span>: I'm Kathleen. Welcome to the company; I work as a network administrator. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kyle</span>: Thank you. My name is Kyle. I'm the new database administrator. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kathleen</span>: Terrific! Can you tell me what your main duties here? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kyle</span>: Sure! I have to plan and develop databases. Likewise, I'm in charge of the security of databases. I set up and test storage in computer systems. I design recovery and backup computer programs, and I solve any problem that front-end users may find. What about you? Can you tell me about your main responsibilities? <br/>"}, {"time": "48000", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kathleen</span>: I'm specialized in analyzing network fulfillment. I install enhancements. I should protect networks by creating access codes. I evaluate the throughput and the latency periods in networks according to the established workflow and policies. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kyle</span>: Wow! You must be very skilled. Could you give me more information about it? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kathleen</span>: Of course! <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kyle</span>: Have you got any special training for this? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kathleen</span>: Yes, I have. I must read IT publications and attend  networking conferences. Do you have the same training?<br />"}, {"time": "79000", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kyle</span>: Kind of. I also have to write data standards and work with multimedia programmers. Have you got any  other tasks?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kathleen</span>: Yes, I have. I must find troubleshooting strategies, and I also have to provide support.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kyle</span>: In my case, I have got to be in contact with technical and operational staff to monitor performance.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kathleen</span>: I think database administration is awesome, but it can be a little complex. Do you have enough experience in databases? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kyle</span>: Yes, I do. I have a lot of experience in this field; in fact, I consider myself to be very professional.<br/>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n4le01ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}